# @hub-lanes

# ── ONBOARD-RUN LANE (BH-7934.2) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Every minute. Picks the oldest queued onboarding run (the console's "add a
# project" form), claims it on the jobs worker and runs its stations in order,
# beating each one running, then done or failed. Alerts once a day on a running
# run with no beat for ONBOARD_RUN_STALE_MIN minutes. The flock is dedupe: a
# long run makes the next ticks skip, it never queues them. Log:
# logs/onboard-run.log. Doc: docs/ONBOARDING.md.
# Off: flags/lane-off-onboard-run (bin/harness-ctl.sh off onboard-run).
* * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && flock -n /root/harness/locks/onboard-run.lock /root/harness/bin/onboard-run.sh >> /root/harness/logs/onboard-run-cron.log 2>&1
